DECLARE `o 18 r 33(12) act` IS ONE OF
    `o 18 r 33(12) file and serve the written submissions`

-- src:2119 | (12) Where the appellant fails to file and serve the written submissions within the specified time, the appeal is deemed withdrawn unless the appellate Court otherwise orders.
@ref O 18 r 33(12) (src:2119)
`o 18 r 33(12) the appellant must file and serve the written submissions within the specified time` MEANS
